---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/FlowIcon.astro';
import FieldNotesPreview from '../components/FieldNotesPreview.astro';
import { productUrl, wanderAppStoreUrl, wanderWebsiteUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
import '../styles/visual-home.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hyphos Inc. — Consulting & software" description="We connect your business systems, website and marketing—and build the software in between. Explore what Hyphos Inc. has built.">
<div class="visual-page">
  <section class="v-hero v-shell">
    <p class="v-eyebrow">Hyphos Inc. · Consulting & software</p>
    <h1>Your best people<br /><em>have better things to do.</em></h1>
    <p class="v-intro">Less chasing information. Less entering it twice. Less holding everything together by hand.</p>
    <p class="v-hero-context">We connect your business systems, website and marketing—and build software around the way your team works.</p>
    <figure class="v-business-flow">
      <div class="v-flow-grid">
        <div class="v-flow-node"><div class="v-mini-screen" aria-hidden="true"><div class="v-screen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="v-mini-content"><Icon name="records" /><div class="v-data-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="v-mini-status"><Icon name="check" />Reviewed by your team</div></div></div><strong>Business data</strong></div>
        <span class="v-flow-arrow" aria-label="feeds">→</span>
        <div class="v-flow-node"><div class="v-mini-screen" aria-hidden="true"><div class="v-screen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><img class="v-website-image" src="/work/cornerstone/website-hero.webp" width="2560" height="1182" alt="" /><div class="v-data-lines v-website-lines"><span></span><span></span></div></div><strong>Public website</strong></div>
        <span class="v-flow-arrow" aria-label="activity informs">→</span>
        <div class="v-flow-node"><div class="v-mini-screen" aria-hidden="true"><div class="v-screen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="v-mini-content"><Icon name="insight" /><div class="v-chart"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="v-mini-status">Traffic · Search · Reviews</div></div></div><strong>Marketing insight</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-feedback"><span>↶ Insight feeds the next business decision</span></div>
      <figcaption class="v-caption">Illustrated connection · Example from our client work, not live metrics</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="v-actions"><a href="#selected-work" class="button button--ink">See what we’ve built ↓</a><a href="#field-notes" class="text-link">Explore the field notes ↓</a></div>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>What does “working together” mean?</summary><div><p>Record information once. Use it where it belongs. Bring the response back into view. We connect the tools your team already uses and build custom software where the gaps are.</p><p><a href="/services">Explore how we help ↗</a></p></div></details>
  </section>
  <section id="selected-work" class="v-chapter v-proof"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">Built by Hyphos</p><h2>Behind the website.<br /><em>A connected business.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v-proof-display">
      <figure><div class="v-portal-frame"><img src="/work/cornerstone/staff-portal.png" width="2912" height="2340" alt="Actual client staff portal, showing its calendar and business navigation" loading="lazy" /></div><figcaption class="v-caption">Actual client software · Staff portal</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="v-proof-points"><div class="v-proof-point"><Icon name="people" /><div><strong>The team</strong><span>Records & daily work</span></div></div><div class="v-proof-point"><Icon name="website" /><div><strong>The customer</strong><span>Website & publishing</span></div></div><div class="v-proof-point"><Icon name="insight" /><div><strong>The next decision</strong><span>Marketing & reporting</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>See how the pieces connect</summary><div><p>For client Cornerstone Funeral Home, service records can supply website content. The public site reads published information, while website activity and available marketing signals feed staff reporting.</p><p><a href="/work/cornerstone">Explore the connected software ↗</a></p></div></details>
    <div class="v-work-links"><a href="/work/cornerstone" class="text-link">Take a closer look ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="v-chapter v-wander"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">Wander · Live on the App Store</p><h2>From “let’s go outside”<br /><em>to out the door.</em></h2><p>A real product, built from the ground up.</p></div>
    <div class="v-wander-shots"><img src="/work/wander/wander-find.webp" width="640" height="1388" alt="Wander map showing nearby parks and playgrounds" loading="lazy" /><img src="/work/wander/wander-check.webp" width="640" height="1388" alt="Wander park details with photos, reviews and amenities" loading="lazy" /><img src="/work/wander/wander-go.webp" width="640" height="1388" alt="Wander event creation for planning an outing" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="v-actions"><a href={wanderAppStoreUrl} class="button button--ink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Wander ↗</a><a href={wanderWebsiteUrl} class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Wander ↗</a></div>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>What we built for Wander</summary><div><p>App development, park discovery, reviews, the public website and the App Store launch. A product partnership from the first idea through release.</p><p><a href="/work#wander">Explore the project ↗</a></p></div></details>
  </div></section>
  <section class="v-chapter"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">Where we can help</p><h2>Start where the work<br /><em>gets stuck.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v-capabilities"><article><Icon name="records" /><h3>Connect your systems.</h3><p>Less copying. Fewer gaps.</p></article><article><Icon name="website" /><h3>Build the missing piece.</h3><p>Software that fits the work.</p></article><article><Icon name="people" /><h3>Put knowledge to work.</h3><p>AI chats, meetings & documents.</p></article></div>
    <div class="v-work-links"><a href="/services" class="text-link">Explore how we help ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <FieldNotesPreview />
  <section class="v-closing v-shell"><h2>Does this happen<br /><em>in your business?</em></h2><p>A question is enough. There’s no need for a prepared brief.</p><div class="v-actions"><a href="mailto:info@hyphos.io?subject=A%20question%20about%20connected%20business%20systems" class="button button--ink">Ask us a question ↗</a><a href="/contact" class="text-link">Talk with us ↗</a></div><p>Opens your email app.</p></section>
  <div class="v-bridge v-shell"><span>Also from Hyphos Inc.</span><a href={productUrl}>Hyphos & Domas: shaped around your business ↗</a></div>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
